  "transcription": "$1 + 240\\left(\\frac{1^3 q}{1-q} + \\frac{2^3 q^2}{1-q^2} + \\cdots\\right) = \\left(\\frac{2K}{\\pi}\\right)^4 (1 + 14k^2 + k^4)$\n$1 + 240\\left(\\frac{1^3 q^4}{1-q^4} + \\frac{2^3 q^8}{1-q^8} + \\cdots\\right) = \\left(\\frac{K}{\\pi}\\right)^4 (1 + 14k'^2 + k'^4)$\n$1 + 240\\left(\\frac{1^3 q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{2^3 q^4}{1-q^4} + \\cdots\\right) = \\left(\\frac{2K}{\\pi}\\right)^4 \\{1 - (kk')^2\\}.$\n\n$1 - 504\\left(\\frac{1^5 q}{1-q} + \\frac{2^5 q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{3^5 q^3}{1-q^3} + \\cdots\\right) = \\left(\\frac{2K}{\\pi}\\right)^6 (1+k^2)(1 - 34k^2 + k^4)$\n$-/ \\quad 1 - 504\\left(\\frac{1^5 q^4}{1-q^4} + \\frac{2^5 q^8}{1-q^8} + \\frac{3^5 q^{12}}{1-q^{12}} + \\cdots\\right) = [-\\,-]\\left(\\frac{K}{\\pi}\\right)^6 (1+k'^2)(1 - 34k'^2 + k'^4)$\n$1 - 504\\left(\\frac{1^5 q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{2^5 q^4}{1-q^4} + \\cdots\\right) = \\left(\\frac{2K}{\\pi}\\right)^6 (k'^2 - k^2)\\{1 + \\tfrac{1}{2}(kk')^2\\}$\n\n$(2^s - 1)\\frac{B_s}{2s} + \\frac{1^{s-1} q}{1-q} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^2}{1+q^2} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^3}{1-q^3} + \\cdots$\n$= 2^s \\left\\{\\frac{B_s}{2s} - \\left(\\frac{1^{s-1} q^4}{1-q^4} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^8}{1-q^8} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^{12}}{1-q^{12}} + \\cdots\\right)\\right\\}$\n$- \\left\\{\\frac{B_s}{2s} - \\left(\\frac{1^{s-1} q}{1-q} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^3}{1-q^3} + \\cdots\\right)\\right\\}.$\n\n$(2^s - 1)\\frac{B_s}{2s} + \\frac{1^{s-1} q}{1+q} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^3}{1+q^3} + \\cdots$\n$= 2^s \\left\\{\\frac{B_s}{2s} + \\left(\\frac{1^{s-1} q^4}{1-q^4} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^8}{1-q^8} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^{12}}{1-q^{12}} + \\cdots\\right)\\right\\}$\n$+ \\left\\{\\frac{B_s}{2s} + \\left(\\frac{1^{s-1} q}{1-q} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^3}{1-q^3} + \\cdots\\right)\\right\\}$\n$- 2\\left\\{\\frac{B_s}{2s} + \\left(\\frac{1^{s-1} q^2}{1-q^2} + \\frac{2^{s-1} q^4}{1-q^4} + \\frac{3^{s-1} q^6}{1-q^6} + \\cdots\\right)\\right\\}.$",
